<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 20/21.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 20/21.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>20/21 at 1100GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons</p>
<p>to a German mark.</p>
<p>March 20/21  March 19/20</p>
<p> CZK	0.45909     0.4625</p>
<p> DKK	2.09592     2.09499</p>
<p> FIM	2.65662     2.65892</p>
<p> HUF	0.0763	0.07642</p>
<p> JPY	0.1092	0.10939</p>
<p> LTL	3.35054     3.36304</p>
<p> LVL     23.1273     23.15764</p>
<p> RUR	0.00234     0.00235</p>
<p> SEK	1.74966     1.74601</p>
<p> UAH	7.28889     7.33704</p>
<p> USD     13.3988     13.4488</p>
<p> XEU     15.47226    15.48428</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
